q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2018 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"We will target leading-edge high growth markets like data center and networking, artificial intelligence, machine learning, IoT, and automotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/28/rambus-inc-rmbs-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"We target performance-driven, high growth markets, including data center, networking, artificial intelligence, machine learning, IoT and automotive where demand for data and security are at their highest.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/rambus-inc-rmbs-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Our high-speed IP Cores business had a tremendous quarter, bringing in record revenue and multiple new SoC design wins for data center, networking and artificial intelligence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/rambus-inc-rmbs-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"The other thing is, you're absolutely right, some of our customers had to move their manufacturing locations from China to other countries to deal with tariff situation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/rambus-inc-rmbs-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Lipacis","x":"I just want to make sure I -- I think I understand what this, is your customers or your customers' customers downstream time to take the manufacturing out of China and putting it in non-tariff locations and then setting up that supply chain and then now you're seeing orders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/rambus-inc-rmbs-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-04-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"So we maintain our guidance of $50 million to $70 million this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/rambus-inc-rmbs-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"As a market leader in memory, PCIe and MIPI digital controllers, Northwest Logic will expand our solutions by creating a complementary product portfolio of PHYs and controllers for data center, AI, communications and automotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/rambus-inc-rmbs-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"We announced the addition of our 112-gig SerDes PHY for 400-gig and 800-gig networking, a win for GDDR6 at Achronix and continued to close new Tier 1 SoC design wins for data center, networking and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/rambus-inc-rmbs-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"As a market leader in memory PCIe and MIPI digital controllers Northwest Logic expands our interface solutions for data center AI communications and automotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/rambus-inc-rmbs-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Much like the purchase of Northwest Logic this anticipated acquisition of the Inside Secure teams and offerings will augment our portfolio of offerings for data center AI networking and automotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/rambus-inc-rmbs-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Suji Desilva","x":"And then a couple more questions before I pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/rambus-inc-rmbs-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2019-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Suji Desilva","x":"And then for the business for '20 you reiterated the guidance from the Analyst Day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/rambus-inc-rmbs-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-01-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Much like the purchase of digital controller company, Northwest Logic, earlier in the year, the Inside Secure teams and offerings augment our portfolio and expand our market position in data center, AI, networking and automotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/27/rambus-inc-rmbs-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2019 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-01-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"In addition, the team continues to build out our portfolio of solutions, addressing the fast growing and demanding applications in AI and 5G and data center with the launch of our comprehensive PCIe Gen 5 interface solution in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/27/rambus-inc-rmbs-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"This strengthens our position in the fast-growing and critical markets of data center, cloud, AI and 5G with additions to both the high-speed interface and security IP portfolios.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/rambus-inc-rmbs-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"The resilience of our business model, ongoing ability to execute and increased demand for our products across the critical markets of data center, communications, AI and 5G give us confidence in our ongoing ability to generate cash, further strengthen our balance sheet and reinvest in our future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/rambus-inc-rmbs-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-08-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Finally, for silicon IP, we maintained our momentum with further interface and security IP design wins at tier 1 SoC makers across data center, AI, and communications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/rambus-rmbs-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"At this speed, our comprehensive solution delivers the highest bandwidth for the most demanding data center applications, including AI, machine learning training and high-end graphics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/rambus-rmbs-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rahul Mathur","x":"We have done a fantastic job over the past couple of years of taking cost out of our company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/rambus-rmbs-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rahul Mathur","x":"And I think as I mentioned earlier, we've done a fantastic job over the last several years taking cost out of our company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/rambus-rmbs-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-02-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"The ongoing shift to the cloud, along with the widespread advancement of artificial intelligence across data center, 5G, automotive, and IoT, has led to an exponential growth in data usage and increasing demands on data infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/01/rambus-rmbs-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-02-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"And you keep listening, hearing us saying about AI, 5G, IoT, auto, cloud, data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/01/rambus-rmbs-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2020 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rahul Mathur","x":"I've been very pleased with our ability to take cost out of the company, specifically around infrastructure, and you've seen that show up in our P&L and spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/01/rambus-rmbs-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2021 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-05-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"AI is going to be consuming a large portion of the data center growth going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/rambus-rmbs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2021 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-05-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"So anyone building a chip for AI that goes into data center will eventually need these high-speed interfaces, mostly HBM, to some extent, GDDR6.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/rambus-rmbs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2021 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rahul Mathur","x":"In terms of an opex perspective, look, I think we've done a fantastic job of improving our operational efficiency and in particularly taking cost out of SG&A. What you've seen is that we've taken probably about $20 million of cost out compared to where we were a couple of years ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/rambus-rmbs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2021 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-08-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Silicon IP revenue was up 10% quarter over quarter, bolstered by a number of design wins as the industry continues to build solutions for data center and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/rambus-rmbs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2021 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-08-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Particularly in high-performance data center and AI applications, we have a growing need for bandwidth and security, and compressed product development time lines are accelerating the need for trusted and reliable off-the-shelf IP.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/rambus-rmbs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2021 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"We expect to see a price increase when we move to DDR5.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/rambus-rmbs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2022 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2022-05-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Our biggest markets continue to be data center and AI and over the course of the quarter, we augmented our silicon IP portfolio with certified solutions to expand our footprint in automotive and government.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/02/rambus-rmbs-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2022 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2022-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Data center and AI are driving robust demand for our high-performance silicon IP solutions, and we are seeing growth in edge, government and automotive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/01/rambus-rmbs-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2022 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2022-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"In the security IP, we address market beyond data centers and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/01/rambus-rmbs-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2025 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2025-07-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"AI and data center applications continue to drive strong demand for our high-speed memory and interconnect IP as well as our security IP.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/rambus-rmbs-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2025 Q2","e":"rmbs","d":"2025-07-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Desmond Lynch","x":"Our robust balance sheet allows us to invest in market expansion opportunities in the data center and AI, while consistently delivering value to our stockholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/rambus-rmbs-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2025 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2025-10-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Leveraging our core expertise in signal and power integrity, our strategic focus on delivering complete solutions for high-performance memory subsystems positions us well amid strong secular trends in data center and AI markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/27/rambus-rmbs-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2025 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2025-10-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"AI workloads demand unprecedented levels of compute performance, driving increasing core counts and the need for more memory bandwidth and capacity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/27/rambus-rmbs-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2025 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2026-02-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Looking ahead, the ongoing expansion of AI and the transformation of the data center continues to reshape memory and interconnect requirements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/02/rambus-rmbs-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2025 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2026-02-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"Our product and IP sit at the core of this transition, enabling the massive compute infrastructure required for increasingly complex and diverse AI models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/02/rambus-rmbs-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2025 Q4","e":"rmbs","d":"2026-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Desmond Lynch","x":"And as always, we'll continue to drive manufacturing cost savings going forward, which enables us to drive to the gross margins within the range I mentioned earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/02/rambus-rmbs-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2026 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2026-04-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"This is an exciting time for Rambus, and we are well positioned to capitalize on the market trends in the data center and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/rambus-rmbs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2026 Q1","e":"rmbs","d":"2026-04-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"To give more context, there are several market and technology trends playing out across the data center and AI that continue to work in our favor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/27/rambus-rmbs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RMBS 2026 Q3","e":"rmbs","d":"2026-10-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Luc Seraphin","x":"We introduced new ch